#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:5
#: f5c6dc1519fd4be7a88aadffe14665a1
msgid "Mission Planner Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:7
#: 70015cca8e65466abfb78d244d7f925e
msgid "Mission Planner is a full-featured ground station application for the ArduPilot open source autopilot project. This page contains information on the background of Mission Planner and the organization of this site."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:12
#: bb9bf57de83649c181fea3aea8e8f98a
msgid "What is Mission Planner"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:17
#: c71bef3cbdaa4bd3b6ccc5262a72e1b6
msgid "Mission Planner is a ground control station for Plane, Copter and Rover. It is compatible with Windows only. Mission Planner can be used as a configuration utility or as a dynamic control supplement for your autonomous vehicle. Here are just a few things you can do with Mission Planner:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:23
#: 3fd7353c709042bd99d285798545081f
msgid "Load the :ref:`firmware <common-glossary>` (the software) into the autopilot board (i.e. Pixhawk series) that controls your vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:25
#: a8bf4519712941efb17547be246233a7
msgid "Setup, configure, and tune your vehicle for optimum performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:26
#: 65e954e8235d445f957f3fb2b8cd1d63
msgid "Plan, save and load autonomous missions into you autopilot with simple point-and-click way-point entry on Google or other maps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:28
#: 481cb6a558ff43079a7adab6a8dbcecb
msgid "Download and analyze mission logs created by your autopilot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:29
#: 6e8f24fa76f44c15bef2789c89c361e9
msgid "Interface with a PC flight simulator to create a full hardware-in-the-loop UAV simulator."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:31
#: 7c48aa4bf5e1498ba1585a32e16fcc21
msgid "With appropriate telemetry hardware you can:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:33
#: 785748eac5d44748918aaa3466e0471b
msgid "Monitor your vehicle's status while in operation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:34
#: 2beb9001eaea4540a896ad2fd631fb6d
msgid "Record telemetry logs which contain much more information about the on-board autopilot logs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:36
#: 28dc715f8a4944f2a05604729afeaac0
msgid "View and analyze the telemetry logs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:37
#: 67d338e6d55f4edc99d1b53c76aa3db4
msgid "Operate your vehicle in FPV (first person view)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:39
#: 3c903dea6b1a401db55b99b79c8fb87d
msgid "All of these and many more features are covered here."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:42
#: 6709b05c012c4adea65b2957bcdcb740
msgid "History"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:44
#: 90e71f3dd4c8473c93ec857f7007983a
msgid "Mission Planner is a free, open-source, community-supported application developed by Michael Oborne for the open-source APM autopilot project. If you would like to donate to the ongoing development of Mission Planner, please refer to the following link."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:49
#: 983b566083804b2588f33c889b07ff1f
msgid ":ref:`Donate <common-donation>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:54
#: 37dde38936d540b68e1f761ea462ac58
msgid "Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:56
#: c41ad0ae29b74e3fb200c22dc62d89a0
msgid "**The Help Screen:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:58
#: 6c69a034669b4adcaae204e26040cbee
msgid "Clicking the Help icon at the top of the Mission Planner interface will open a screen with general information about help with Mission Planner. The \"Check for Updates\" button will check for available updates to Mission Planner manually. Mission Planner automatically checks for updates upon start up and notifies you if an update is available. Please always run the most current version of Mission Planner, although it is not necessary to check for updates more often than upon start up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:66
#: 09bb327adfb041619fc0cb603854c7b3
msgid "The \"Check for BETA Updates\" button will install the current development version of Mission Planner. This contains all the latest features and updates, but also might have bugs, since it does not have extensive community testing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:68
#: df3bdb6b248b4562b6e5e56982e4375b
msgid "At the bottom of the HELP screen is the check box \"Show Console Window (restart)\" , which enables the console window during Mission Planner operation.  That window shows Mission Planner activity and is primarily for diagnostic purposes.  It sometimes shows some interesting information. A restart of Mission Planner is required for the option to take effect."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:73
#: 8171173412d64096899e516cd74d16cd
msgid "**Getting Help:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:75
#: 9d16c53c668241faa834acd8eeec6f3f
msgid "The support for Mission Planner comes from the community of users like you.  All of the documentation is created by users who volunteer their time. If you have questions, first look through the table of contents (upper left of every page) for a topic that may address your question. Next, try a search of the website.  If you still need help, then the community forums are the place to go. There you will find may friendly users, developers and often, even Michael will chime in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:83
#: 5c75462d689e4218a7df3f45e2c5ea57
msgid "The ArduPilot forum `here <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__ has existed for years and has a very large community and numerous general and vehicle specific topics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:87
#: 2c8322d49bfe408bb558715d79ba1c68
msgid "**Reporting Issues:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:89
#: 4e9ca1b3189a4cdcbcebf547de705fde
msgid "You can often resolve a question on a forum. Sometimes you will discover a bug and use the forums to request it be logged as an official issue. One of the developers will normally be glad to do so."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:93
#: 64a2241f4fc0436188f355ce3162f651
msgid "If you see a need to change or enhance the documentation, please let us know - again using the forums.  We welcome your suggestions and there are qualified editors who can implement your suggestions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:98
#: ad666b3fb2864487a0f8ed7ab6e7bca6
msgid "Navigating the Documentation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:100
#: 63146208c0654329a75f4a442d6dba43
msgid "Use the table of contents at the top of each page to navigate the Mission Planner Manual - and the contents of the vehicle specific areas."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:103
#: 748325ff4e2c455f8e87e911fe701014
msgid "This section of our website contains information on how to use Mission Planner as a \"general\" application. However, some of the pages will also have some vehicle specific information. Those pages will also be contained in the specific vehicle's section of the website. Information that is primarily specific to a particular vehicle will only be located in that vehicles section so, if you cannot find information here, try the section of the website for the vehicle you are using."
msgstr ""
